-- WoW Forever: the Balance druid talent rework of 25 November 2026 (build 1.60.1.71139), as Blizzard's trait and curve records.
-- From the Everlake tracker's checkout of step 71139+1, now that it reads the trait tables and Curve/CurvePoint; only the rows
-- hotfixes_ptr did not already hold exactly (2026_11_26_00 has the day's spell and item records). Blizzard's values unchanged.
--   trait_node_entry 129593: Improved Starfire to 2 ranks (MaxRanks 2); curve 109039 its stun chance 8/15%, its rank 3-5
--     points removed (curve_point 328044-328046, hotfix_data status 2).
--   trait_definition 134397: Dreamstate 408258 (replaces Moonfury); curve 85335 its share 20/40/60/80/100%.
--   trait_definition_effect_points 25238-25241: Moon and Stars pushback protection 50/100% (curve 129045), Eclipse's Wrath
--     critical strike 7/13/20% (curves 129042, 129043) and its 2-point effect (129044).
--   The other curves (23847, 23848, 128304 and their points, 85272, 97574) are Blizzard's records the realm lacked.
-- The core does the rest: players whose saved talents hold more ranks than a node has now get every point back at login
-- (Player::_LoadTraits), and Dreamstate's share of Innervate is classic_talent_dru_dreamstate on 29166.
-- hotfix_data ids 2117289-2117336. Safe to run again.

DELETE FROM `curve` WHERE `ID` IN (23847,23848,128304,129042,129043,129044,129045);

DELETE FROM `curve_point` WHERE `ID` IN (77130,77131,77132,77133,251264,251265,251266,251469,251470,251471,251472,251473,295686,295687,295688,295689,295690,328042,328043,372543,372544,374357,374358,374359,374360,374361,374362,374363,374364,374365,374366,374367);

